ples</h2><br> <code>GET /addresses</code> <br><br> <code>GET /addresses?customer_id=&lt;customer_id&gt;</code><br><br> <code>GET /addresses?discount_id=&lt;discount_id&gt;</code><br><br> <code>GET /addresses?discount_code=&lt;discount_code&gt;</code></p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <div class="notes" data-v-7c527c32><p>You can combine <code>created_at_min</code> and <code>created_at_max</code> to return all addresses created in the given timespan. This also applies to <code>updated_at_min</code> and <code>updated_at_max</code> parameters.</p>
