</div></div><div class="h-5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-pink mr-3"><div class="tags text-normal text-xs text-white"><p><a href='#tags_legend'>RCS</a></p>
</div></div><div class="h-5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-pink mr-3"><div class="tags text-normal text-xs text-white"><p><a href='#tags_legend'>SCI</a></p>
</div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div> <div class="section-description" data-v-7c527c32><p>A bundle selection represents the contents within a Bundle linked to an individual Subscription. It can represent the selection for upcoming orders or past orders. A <code>BundleSelection</code> is associated with a corresponding <code>Subscription</code> and a <code>BundleVariant</code> (the <code>BundleVariant</code> is used to validate contents in the selection).</p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div class="mt-5 font-medium" data-v-7c527c32><div><h5 class="py-3 border-b border-attributesBorder">Attributes</h5> <ul><li><div class="attributes-row border-b border-attributesBorder py-5" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="flex items-center mb-3" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name-container" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name px-2 py-px text-center text-xs text-white rounded-md font-mono font-normal leading-5 bg-attributesBackground" data-v-49d00812 data-v-592d6e6a>
        id
      </div> <!----></div> <div class="attribute-type text-attributeType font-mono text-xs font-extralight ml-4" data-v-592d6e6a><span data-v-592d6e6a>
        integer
      </span> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div class="tags-container flex items-center" data-v-592d6e6a><!----> <!----></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-592d6e6a><div data-v-592d6e6a><p>The unique numeric identifier for the <code>BundleSelection</code>.</p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <div data-v-592d6e6a><!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></li><li><div class="attributes-row border-b border-attributesBorder py-5" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="flex items-center mb-3" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name-container" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name px-2 py-px text-center text-xs text-white rounded-md font-mono font-normal leading-5 bg-attributesBackground" data-v-49d00812 data-v-592d6e6a>
        bundle_variant_id
      </div> <!----></div> <div class="attribute-type text-attributeType font-mono text-xs font-extralight ml-4" data-v-592d6e6a><span data-v-592d6e6a>
        integer
      </span> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div class="tags-container flex items-center" data-v-592d6e6a><!----> <!----></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-592d6e6a><div data-v-592d6e6a><p>The ID of the <code>BundleVariant</code> associated with the <code>BundleSelection</code>.</p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <div data-v-592d6e6a><!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></li><li><div class="attributes-row border-b border-attributesBorder py-5" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="flex items-center mb-3" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name-container" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name px-2 py-px text-center text-xs text-white rounded-md font-mono font-normal leading-5 bg-attributesBackground" data-v-49d00812 data-v-592d6e6a>
