</div></div><div class="h-5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-pink mr-3"><div class="tags text-normal text-xs text-white"><p><a href='#tags_legend'>RCS</a></p>
</div></div><div class="h-5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-pink mr-3"><div class="tags text-normal text-xs text-white"><p><a href='#tags_legend'>SCI</a></p>
</div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div> <div class="section-description" data-v-7c527c32><p>Modify an existing <code>BundleSelection</code> to match the specified parameters.</p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <div class="notes" data-v-7c527c32><p><code>BundleSelections</code> endpoints are available for Recharge Plus merchants. If you’re interested in leveraging the Recharge <code>bundle_selections</code> endpoints, reach out to your account manager or our Support team. <br>&lt;a href=‘https://getrecharge.com/why-recharge/ target=’_blank’&gt;Learn more about Recharge Plus</a>.</p>
</div> <div class="mt-8" data-v-7f693ec6><span class="text-sm text-mainText" data-v-7f693ec6>Scopes:</span> <span class="inline-block border border-white shadow-keyline text-sm text-mainText rounded-md px-1 py-0.5 mb-1 mr-1 lowercase font-mono font-extralight scope" data-v-7f693ec6>
    write_subscriptions
  </span></div> <!----> <div class="mt-5 font-medium" data-v-7c527c32><!----> <!----> <div><h5 class="py-3 border-b border-attributesBorder">Body Parameters</h5> <ul><li><div class="attributes-row border-b border-attributesBorder py-5" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="flex items-center mb-3" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name-container" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name px-2 py-px text-center text-xs text-white rounded-md font-mono font-normal leading-5 bg-attributesBackground" data-v-49d00812 data-v-592d6e6a>
        purchase_item_id
      </div> <!----></div> <div class="attribute-type text-attributeType font-mono text-xs font-extralight ml-4" data-v-592d6e6a><span data-v-592d6e6a>
        integer
      </span> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div class="tags-container flex items-center" data-v-592d6e6a><!----> <!----></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-592d6e6a><div data-v-592d6e6a><p>The ID of the <code>PurchaseItem</code> associated with the <code>BundleSelection</code>.</p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <div data-v-592d6e6a><!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></li><li><div class="attributes-row border-b border-attributesBorder py-5" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="flex items-center mb-3" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name-container" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name px-2 py-px text-center text-xs text-white rounded-md font-mono font-normal leading-5 bg-attributesBackground" data-v-49d00812 data-v-592d6e6a>
        plan_id
      </div> <!----></div> <div class="attribute-type text-attributeType font-mono text-xs font-extralight ml-4" data-v-592d6e6a><span data-v-592d6e6a>
        integer
      </span> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div class="tags-container flex items-center" data-v-592d6e6a><!----> <!----></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-592d6e6a><div data-v-592d6e6a><p>A Recharge Plan ID. If provided in a dynamically-priced Bundle, the unit price of each product variant will be inferred from the plan associated with the ID; otherwise, it will be inferred from the plan with the greatest discount for each product in the selection. This is not used in fixed-priced Bundles.</p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <div data-v-592d6e6a><!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></li><li><div class="attributes-row border-b border-attributesBorder py-5" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="flex items-center mb-3" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name-container" data-v-592d6e6a><div class="attribute-name px-2 py-px text-center text-xs text-white rounded-md font-mono font-normal leading-5 bg-attributesBackground" data-v-49d00812 data-v-592d6e6a>
        items
      </div> <!----></div> <div class="attribute-type text-attributeType font-mono text-xs font-extralight ml-4" data-v-592d6e6a><span data-v-592d6e6a>
