              </option></select></label></div></div> <div class="flex mr-2" data-v-e5c496f2><button id="clipboardCopy" data-v-e5c496f2><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="copy" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="text-gray-400 svg-inline--fa fa-copy fa-w-14" data-v-e5c496f2 data-v-e5c496f2><path fill="currentColor" d="M320 448v40c0 13.255-10.745 24-24 24H24c-13.255 0-24-10.745-24-24V120c0-13.255 10.745-24 24-24h72v296c0 30.879 25.121 56 56 56h168zm0-344V0H152c-13.255 0-24 10.745-24 24v368c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h272c13.255 0 24-10.745 24-24V128H344c-13.2 0-24-10.8-24-24zm120.971-31.029L375.029 7.029A24 24 0 0 0 358.059 0H352v96h96v-6.059a24 24 0 0 0-7.029-16.97z" data-v-e5c496f2 data-v-e5c496f2></path></svg></button></div></div> <div class="__vuescroll" style="height:100%;width:100%;padding:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;" data-v-e5c496f2><div class="__panel __hidebar" style="position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;height:100%;overflow-y:hidden;overflow-x:hidden;transform-origin:;transform:;"><div class="__view" style="position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:100%;min-height:100%;"><div class="rounded-b-lg pt-3 pb-2 code-block" data-v-e5c496f2><div class="p-3 font-extralight" data-v-e5c496f2> <pre><code class="hljs json"><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>  <div class="divider" data-v-7c527c32></div></div></div></section></section><section class="section-expanded flex flex-col items-center DocSearch-content section-collapsed" data-v-0edaa383><div id="charges" class="api-section w-full" data-v-0edaa383><!----> <div class="w-full" data-v-7c527c32><div class="p-5 md:p-10 lg:flex lg:p-10 xl:p-8 xl:pt-20 lg:w-full" data-v-7c527c32><div class="api-section-left-side lg:pr-10 lg:w-2/3 overflow-x-hidden" data-v-7c527c32><div class="py-2" data-v-7c527c32><div class="flex items-center cursor-pointer relative" data-v-7c527c32><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="link" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" name="charges" class="text-gray-400 anchor-icon svg-inline--fa fa-link fa-w-16" style="display:none;" data-v-7c527c32 data-v-7c527c32><path fill="currentColor" d="M326.612 185.391c59.747 59.809 58.927 155.698.36 214.59-.11.12-.24.25-.36.37l-67.2 67.2c-59.27 59.27-155.699 59.262-214.96 0-59.27-59.26-59.27-155.7 0-214.96l37.106-37.106c9.84-9.84 26.786-3.3 27.294 10.606.648 17.722 3.826 35.527 9.69 52.721 1.986 5.822.567 12.262-3.783 16.612l-13.087 13.087c-28.026 28.026-28.905 73.66-1.155 101.96 28.024 28.579 74.086 28.749 102.325.51l67.2-67.19c28.191-28.191 28.073-73.757 0-101.83-3.701-3.694-7.429-6.564-10.341-8.569a16.037 16.037 0 0 1-6.947-12.606c-.396-10.567 3.348-21.456 11.698-29.806l21.054-21.055c5.521-5.521 14.182-6.199 20.584-1.731a152.482 152.482 0 0 1 20.522 17.197zM467.547 44.449c-59.261-59.262-155.69-59.27-214.96 0l-67.2 67.2c-.12.12-.25.25-.36.37-58.566 58.892-59.387 154.781.36 214.59a152.454 152.454 0 0 0 20.521 17.196c6.402 4.468 15.064 3.789 20.584-1.731l21.054-21.055c8.35-8.35 12.094-19.239 11.698-29.806a16.037 16.037 0 0 0-6.947-12.606c-2.912-2.005-6.64-4.875-10.341-8.569-28.073-28.073-28.191-73.639 0-101.83l67.2-67.19c28.239-28.239 74.3-28.069 102.325.51 27.75 28.3 26.872 73.934-1.155 101.96l-13.087 13.087c-4.35 4.35-5.769 10.79-3.783 16.612 5.864 17.194 9.042 34.999 9.69 52.721.509 13.906 17.454 20.446 27.294 10.606l37.106-37.106c59.271-59.259 59.271-155.699.001-214.959z" data-v-7c527c32 data-v-7c527c32></path></svg> <div class="flex items-center" data-v-7c527c32><h1 name="charges" data-v-7c527c32><div data-v-7c527c32>Charges</div></h1> <div class="tags" data-v-7c527c32><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></div></div> <div class="section-description" data-v-7c527c32><p>A charge is the representation of a financial transaction linked to the purchase of an item (past or future). It can be a transaction that was processed already or the representation of an upcoming transaction. A <code>Charge</code> is linked to its corresponding <code>Orders</code> (one <code>Order</code> for pay as you go subscriptions and several for pre-paid). <code>Orders</code> are created once the corresponding <code>Charge</code> is successful. After successful payment, the first <code>Order</code> will be immediately submitted to the external platform if applicable (e.g. Shopify, BigCommerce). <img src="/images/charge.png" alt=""></p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <div class="lg:w-1/3" data-v-7c527c32><div class="sticky mt-5 lg:mt-16 top-5 lg:top-24" data-v-7c527c32><div data-v-7c527c32><div class="flex mb-3 justify-center" data-v-e5c496f2><div class="flex flex-col w-full bg-example-request-bg rounded-lg shadow-keyline max-w-screen-sm" data-v-e5c496f2><div class="flex bg-example-request-topbar-bg rounded-t-lg p-1" data-v-e5c496f2><div class="flex items-center text-example-request-topbar-color text-sm uppercase p-2 overflow-hidden font-extralight flex-grow" data-v-e5c496f2>Endpoints</div> <!----> <!----></div> <div class="__vuescroll" style="height:100%;width:100%;padding:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;" data-v-e5c496f2><div class="__panel __hidebar" style="position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;height:100%;overflow-y:hidden;overflow-x:hidden;transform-origin:;transform:;"><div class="__view" style="position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:100%;min-height:100%;"><div class="rounded-b-lg pt-3 pb-2 code-block" data-v-e5c496f2><div class="p-3 font-extralight" data-v-e5c496f2> <div><!----></div><div><div class="flex mb-1 pl-5 cursor-pointer"><div class="mr-2 w-14 text-right text-verbGet">
  GET
</div> <div class="text-smoke">
                /charges/{id}
              </div></div></div><div><div class="flex mb-1 pl-5 cursor-pointer"><div class="mr-2 w-14 text-right text-verbGet">
