</div> <!----> <!----> <div class="notes" data-v-7c527c32><p>You cannot add a <code>Discount</code> to an existing queued <code>Charge</code> if the <code>Charge</code> or the associated <code>Address</code> already has one.<br><br>You can provide either <code>discount_id</code> or <code>discount_code</code>. If both parameters are passed, the value for <code>discount_id</code> will take precedence.<br><br>If a <code>Charge</code> has a <code>Discount</code> and it gets updated, or a regeneration occurs, the <code>Discount</code> will be lost. Regeneration is a process that refreshes the <code>Charge</code> JSON with new data in the case of the <code>Subscription</code> or <code>Address</code> being updated.</p>
</div> <div class="mt-8" data-v-7f693ec6><span class="text-sm text-mainText" data-v-7f693ec6>Scopes:</span> <span class="inline-block border border-white shadow-keyline text-sm text-mainText rounded-md px-1 py-0.5 mb-1 mr-1 lowercase font-mono font-extralight scope" data-v-7f693ec6>
