</div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div> <div class="section-description" data-v-7c527c32><p>The charge processing route can be used to process <code>Charges</code> that are in a <code>queued</code> or <code>error</code> status.</p>
</div> <div class="mt-2"><p>
    Related guides:
    <a href="https://docs.rechargepayments.com/docs/charges#charges-faq" target="_blank">
      Charges FAQ
    </a></p></div> <!----> <div class="notes" data-v-7c527c32><p>The <code>/charges/{id}/process</code> endpoint is available to Recharge Plus merchants on a request basis. If you’re interested in leveraging the Recharge <code>Charge</code> processing API, reach out to your account manager or our Support team.<br><a href='https://getrecharge.com/why-recharge/' target='_blank'>Learn more about Recharge Plus</a>.</p>
