</div> <!----> <!----> <div class="notes" data-v-592d6e6a><p>Important: You can only set <code>applied_shipping_rate</code> if you have already collected the <code>available_shipping_rates</code> by calling <code>GET /checkout/&lt;checkout_token&gt;/shipping_rates</code> or if you pass the query parameter <code>get_shipping_rates=true</code> when calling this route.<br/><br/><code>code</code>, <code>price</code> and <code>title</code> are required when setting a custom shipping rate</p>
