</div></div><div class="h-5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-pink mr-3"><div class="tags text-normal text-xs text-white"><p><a href='#tags_legend'>RCS</a></p>
</div></div><div class="h-5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-pink mr-3"><div class="tags text-normal text-xs text-white"><p><a href='#tags_legend'>SCI</a></p>
</div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div> <div class="section-description" data-v-7c527c32><p>Create a customer in Recharge.</p>
</div> <!----> <!----> <div class="notes" data-v-7c527c32><p>If you plan to add payment information, <b>it must be the tokenized customer representation. We do not accept card data directly</b>. For Stripe users, please make sure it starts with ‘cus’ and not with a 'tok’, as the 'cus’ is prefix for customer token, and 'tok’ is prefix for payment token.<br><br>Creating a customer in Recharge will not create the customer on any other platform at this time. <br><br> <code>write_payment_methods</code> permission is only required when creating customers with payment token information, or updating payment token information on a customer.</br></br><code>phone</code> must be in E.164 format, such as <code>+16175551212</code>.</p>
</div> <div class="mt-8" data-v-7f693ec6><span class="text-sm text-mainText" data-v-7f693ec6>Scopes:</span> <span class="inline-block border border-white shadow-keyline text-sm text-mainText rounded-md px-1 py-0.5 mb-1 mr-1 lowercase font-mono font-extralight scope" data-v-7f693ec6>
    write_customers
  </span><span class="inline-block border border-white shadow-keyline text-sm text-mainText rounded-md px-1 py-0.5 mb-1 mr-1 lowercase font-mono font-extralight scope" data-v-7f693ec6>
