/code> <br><br> <code>GET /customers?email=example@email.com</code> <br><br> <code>GET /customers?hash=143806234a9ff87a8d9e</code> <br><br> <code>GET /customers?limit=250</code> <br><br> <code>GET /customers?page=2</code><br><br> <code>GET /customers?external_customer_id=98273498</code></p>
