</div> <!----> <!----> <div class="notes" data-v-592d6e6a><p>To update the <code>Payment Method</code> that will be used for processing charges for a specific <code>Address</code>, use <a href='https://developer.getrecharge.com/2021-11/addresses/update_address' target='_blank'>Update an address method</a> with a <code>payment_method_id</code>.</p>
