</div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div> <div class="section-description" data-v-7c527c32><p>Create a new product in your Recharge Product Catalog. After adding the record, subscription preferences may be added using the Products page of Recharge Admin Portal or you can use the <code>Plans</code> resource currently in <code>Alpha</code>.</p>
